<title>JAPAN: S&amp;P assigns AA rating to McDonald's samurais.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P assigns AA rating to McDonald's samurais.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's Corp (S&amp;P) said on Tuesday that it had assigned an AA rating to McDonald's Corp's 30 billion yen worth of five percent yen/U.S. dollar dual currency bonds due May 16, 2000.</p>
<p>The rating outlook was stable, S&amp;P said in a statement.</p>
